---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="The Rispak Stables — Daf Yomi Game: Chullin 79"
  description="Chullin 79: is a mule its mother's child, its father's, or both? Rabbi Abba sends you to the stables before dawn — listen to each bray (Abaye's test), read each ear and tail (Rav Pappa's test), and harness only mules that match. Then face the koy at the gate."
>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link
    rel="stylesheet"
    href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Frank+Ruhl+Libre:wght@400;700;900&display=swap"
  />

  <main class="min-h-screen bg-[#0b0d12] !text-[#e6e1d5]">
    <!-- ============ Hero ============ -->
    <div class="border-b border-[#2a2c38] bg-gradient-to-b from-[#151827]/80 to-transparent px-4 pt-10 pb-8 text-center">
      <p class="mb-3 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] !text-[#b3924f]">
        <a href="/daf" class="hover:!text-[#e0a458]">daf yomi arcade</a> · chullin 79 · 2026-07-19
      </p>
      <h1 class="frank text-4xl font-black tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">🐴 The Rispak Stables</h1>
      <p class="frank mt-1 text-2xl !text-[#e0a458]" dir="rtl" lang="he">כּוּדַנְיָיתָא בְּרִיסְפַּק</p>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-sm leading-relaxed !text-[#a3a08f]">
        Today's daf asks one question in a dozen costumes:
        <span class="frank !text-[#cfc39e]" dir="rtl" lang="he">חוֹשְׁשִׁין לְזֶרַע הָאָב?</span> —
        <em>do we reckon with the father's seed?</em> A mule has a horse in it and a donkey in it;
        which one is it? Rabbi Abba told his attendant:
        <span class="frank !text-[#e0a458]" dir="rtl" lang="he">אִי מְעַיְּילַתְּ לִי כּוּדַנְיָיתָא בְּרִיסְפַּק, עַיֵּין לְהָנָךְ דְּדָמְיָין לַהֲדָדֵי</span>
        — <em>"if you bring me mules for the wagon, look for ones that are similar to each other"</em> (79a:13).
        <strong class="!text-[#e6e1d5]">This morning, you are that attendant.</strong>
        It is dark in the stables. You have two tests, three wagons, and eight mules —
        and yoking a donkey's daughter with a horse's daughter is kilayim.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-4 pb-16 pt-8">
      <!-- ============ Field guide ============ -->
      <div class="mb-6 rounded-2xl border border-[#3a3320] bg-[#14120b] p-5">
        <p class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] !text-[#b3924f]">the field guide — simanim of the sages · 79a:11</p>
        <div class="mt-3 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-[#2e2a1c] bg-[#0f0e09] p-3">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold !text-[#e0a458]">🔊 Abaye's test — the voice</p>
            <p class="frank mt-1 text-base leading-snug !text-[#cfc39e]" dir="rtl" lang="he">עָבֵי קָלֵיהּ – בַּר חַמָּרָא, צְנִיף קָלֵיהּ – בַּר סוּסְיָא</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed !text-[#a3a08f]">Deep voice — a donkey's child. Shrill voice — a horse's child.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-[#2e2a1c] bg-[#0f0e09] p-3">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold !text-[#e0a458]">📏 Rav Pappa's test — ears &amp; tail</p>
            <p class="frank mt-1 text-base leading-snug !text-[#cfc39e]" dir="rtl" lang="he">רַבְרְבָן אוּדְנֵיהּ וְזוּטְרָא גְּנוּבְתֵיהּ – בַּר חַמָּרָא, זוּטְרָן אוּדְנֵיהּ וְרַבָּה גְּנוּבְתֵיהּ – בַּר סוּסְיָא</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed !text-[#a3a08f]">Big ears &amp; short tail — a donkey's child. Small ears &amp; long tail — a horse's child.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3 text-xs !text-[#6e6b5d]">
          The signs go by the <em>mother</em> — and the daf rules the signs are Torah-law:
          <span class="frank !text-[#cfc39e]" dir="rtl" lang="he">וְסִימָנִין דְּאוֹרָיְיתָא</span> (79b:1).
          Yoke together only mules whose signs agree.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div id="game-area">
        <!-- ============ Status ============ -->
        <div class="mb-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
          <div id="wagon-badges" class="flex gap-2" aria-label="Wagons sent"></div>
          <div class="shrink-0 text-right text-xs" aria-live="polite">
            <span id="strike-tally" class="!text-[#8a8778]">⚠️ 0 kilayim strikes</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ============ The wagon ============ -->
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#3a3320] bg-gradient-to-b from-[#171408] to-[#100e08] p-5">
          <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3">
            <span id="wagon-kicker" class="font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] !text-[#b3924f]">rispak 1 of 3</span>
            <span class="frank text-lg !text-[#cfc39e]" dir="rtl" lang="he">רִיסְפַּק</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="frank mt-1 text-2xl font-bold !text-[#e6e1d5]">Rabbi Abba's wagon</h2>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm !text-[#a3a08f]">Two mules to a pole. Harness a matched pair, then drive.</p>
          <div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
            <button id="slot-0" class="slot rounded-xl border-2 border-dashed border-[#4a4128] bg-[#0f0d07] p-3 text-center text-xs !text-[#8a8778] transition-colors hover:border-[#b3924f]" aria-label="Wagon slot 1 — empty">
              <span class="block text-2xl">🪢</span>near pole — empty
            </button>
            <button id="slot-1" class="slot rounded-xl border-2 border-dashed border-[#4a4128] bg-[#0f0d07] p-3 text-center text-xs !text-[#8a8778] transition-colors hover:border-[#b3924f]" aria-label="Wagon slot 2 — empty">
              <span class="block text-2xl">🪢</span>far pole — empty
            </button>
          </div>
          <button id="btn-drive" disabled class="mt-4 w-full rounded-xl bg-[#e0a458] px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold !text-[#14120b] transition-colors hover:bg-[#eebb72] disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-30 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[#eebb72]">
            Drive the rispak →
          </button>
          <div id="wagon-verdict" class="mt-3 hidden rounded-xl p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed" aria-live="polite"></div>
        </div>

        <!-- ============ The stable ============ -->
        <div class="mt-6">
          <div class="mb-2 flex items-baseline justify-between">
            <h2 class="frank text-xl font-bold !text-[#e6e1d5]">The stable, before dawn</h2>
            <span class="text-xs !text-[#6e6b5d]">tap a mule to inspect her</span>
          </div>
          <div id="stable-grid" class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 sm:grid-cols-4"></div>
        </div>

        <!-- ============ Inspection ============ -->
        <div id="insp" class="mt-4 hidden rounded-2xl border border-[#3a4150] bg-[#10131b] p-5">
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3">
            <div>
              <p class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] !text-[#8fa0c0]">under the lantern</p>
              <h3 id="insp-name" class="frank text-2xl font-bold !text-[#e6e1d5]"></h3>
            </div>
            <button id="btn-close" class="rounded-lg border border-[#3a4150] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs !text-[#a3a08f] hover:border-[#8fa0c0] hover:!text-[#e6e1d5]">✕ step back</button>
          </div>
          <div id="insp-svg" class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-[280px]"></div>
          <div class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-[#2a2c38] bg-[#0b0d12] p-3">
              <button id="btn-listen" class="shrink-0 rounded-lg bg-[#8fa0c0] px-3 py-2 text-xs font-bold !text-[#10131b] transition-colors hover:bg-[#aebdd8] focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[#aebdd8]">🔊 Listen</button>
              <p class="!text-[#a3a08f]"><span class="font-bold !text-[#8fa0c0]">Abaye's test:</span> <span id="voice-readout">prod her and listen.</span></p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-[#2a2c38] bg-[#0b0d12] p-3">
              <span class="shrink-0 rounded-lg bg-[#1c202c] px-3 py-2 text-xs font-bold !text-[#8fa0c0]">📏 Look</span>
              <p class="!text-[#a3a08f]"><span class="font-bold !text-[#8fa0c0]">Rav Pappa's test:</span> <span id="body-readout"></span></p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <button id="btn-harness" class="mt-4 w-full rounded-xl bg-[#e0a458] px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold !text-[#14120b] transition-colors hover:bg-[#eebb72] disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-30 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[#eebb72]">
            🪢 Harness her to the rispak
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ============ Interstitial: road home ============ -->
      <div id="mid" class="hidden rounded-2xl border border-[#3a3320] bg-[#14120b] p-6">
        <p class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] !text-[#b3924f]">three wagons on the road</p>
        <p class="frank mt-2 text-2xl font-bold !text-[#e0a458]" dir="rtl" lang="he">הַכֹּל מוֹדִין בִּפְרִי עִם הָאֵם שֶׁאָסוּר</p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed !text-[#a3a08f]">
          The mute, cropped mules stay in the stable — <span class="frank !text-[#cfc39e]" dir="rtl" lang="he">אִלֶּמֶת וְגִידֶּמֶת</span>,
          with no voice for Abaye and nothing left for Rav Pappa to measure, no one can ever vouch for
          their kind (79a:11). And the daf closes the question it opened: Rav Huna son of Rav Yehoshua rules
          that <em>all</em> agree a mule may not even be bred to its own mother's species — because Rabbi
          Yehuda himself was never certain the father's seed doesn't count (79a:12). Doubt, it turns out,
          is the daf's answer. And doubt is waiting for you at the city gate, wearing horns:
          the <strong class="!text-[#e6e1d5]">koy</strong> — Rav Ḥisda's goat-and-gazelle hybrid (79b:2).
        </p>
        <button id="btn-road" class="mt-4 rounded-xl bg-[#e0a458] px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold !text-[#14120b] transition-colors hover:bg-[#eebb72]">Walk the road home →</button>
      </div>

      <!-- ============ The koy gate ============ -->
      <div id="koy" class="mt-6 hidden">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#2c3a30] bg-[#0d120e] p-5">
          <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3">
            <span id="koy-kicker" class="font-mono text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] !text-[#7fae8b]">the koy gate · case 1 of 4</span>
            <span class="frank text-lg !text-[#a8c9ae]" dir="rtl" lang="he">כּוֹי</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="frank mt-1 text-2xl font-bold !text-[#e6e1d5]">Amud bet: rule on the hybrid</h2>
          <p id="koy-scene" class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed !text-[#a3a08f]"></p>
          <p id="koy-q" class="mt-2 text-sm font-bold !text-[#e6e1d5]"></p>
          <div id="koy-choices" class="mt-3 space-y-2"></div>
          <div id="koy-feedback" class="mt-3 hidden rounded-xl p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed" aria-live="polite"></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ============ End screen ============ -->
      <div id="end-screen" class="mt-6 hidden">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#5a4a26] bg-gradient-to-b from-[#171408] to-[#100e08] p-8 text-center">
          <p class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] !text-[#e0a458]">rabbi abba's assessment</p>
          <div id="final-score" class="frank mt-2 text-5xl font-black !text-[#e6e1d5]"></div>
          <div id="final-grade" class="frank mt-3 text-2xl font-bold !text-[#e0a458]" dir="rtl" lang="he"></div>
          <p id="final-line" class="mx-auto mt-2 max-w-md text-sm !text-[#a3a08f]"></p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
          <button id="btn-replay" class="rounded-xl border border-[#4a4128] px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold !text-[#e6e1d5] transition-colors hover:border-[#b3924f] hover:!text-[#e0a458]">↻ Back to the stables</button>
          <button id="btn-share" class="rounded-xl bg-[#e0a458] px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold !text-[#14120b] transition-colors hover:bg-[#eebb72]">Share score</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ============ Learn the real daf ============ -->
      <div class="mt-14 border-t border-[#2a2c38] pt-8">
        <h3 class="frank mb-3 text-xl font-bold !text-[#e0a458]">Learn the real daf</h3>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed !text-[#a3a08f]">
          Everything above is straight from Chullin 79. The amud opens by closing yesterday's dispute —
          Shmuel rules like Ḥananya, that <em>oto v'et beno</em> binds fathers too — and then rides that
          question into the world of mules: Rabbi Yehuda permits mating any two foals of mares with each
          other, because for him species follows the mother (79a:2–3). But is he <em>certain</em> the
          father doesn't count, or merely in doubt? The Gemara chases the answer through the baraita of the
          mule in heat — <span class="frank !text-[#cfc39e]" dir="rtl" lang="he">אֵין מַרְבִּיעִין עָלֶיהָ לֹא סוּס וְלֹא חֲמוֹר, אֶלָּא מִינָהּ</span> —
          past Abaye's voice test and Rav Pappa's ears-and-tail test, to Rav Huna son of Rav Yehoshua's
          conclusion: all agree even the mother's own species is forbidden to her — doubt it is (79a:10–12).
          Rabbi Abba's wagon order (79a:13) shows the signs may be relied on by Torah law. The second amud
          turns to the koy of a goat and a doe: Rav Ḥisda's two concessions (79b:3–4), why the koy's blood
          is not covered on a Festival (79b:12), and the marvelous half-gifts of the priesthood — where the
          owner tells the priest, for the father's half: <em>bring proof, then take it</em> (79b:17).
        </p>
        <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs">
          <a href="https://www.sefaria.org/Chullin.79a" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="rounded-full border border-[#5a4a26] bg-[#171408]/60 px-3 py-1.5 !text-[#e0a458] hover:border-[#b3924f]">Chullin 79 on Sefaria ↗</a>
          <span class="rounded-full border border-[#2a2c38] px-3 py-1.5 !text-[#a3a08f]">Rashi ×53</span>
          <span class="rounded-full border border-[#2a2c38] px-3 py-1.5 !text-[#a3a08f]">Steinsaltz ×31</span>
          <span class="rounded-full border border-[#2a2c38] px-3 py-1.5 !text-[#a3a08f]">Rabbeinu Gershom ×12</span>
          <span class="rounded-full border border-[#2a2c38] px-3 py-1.5 !text-[#a3a08f]">Jastrow ×11</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-6 text-xs !text-[#6e6b5d]">
          Part of the <a href="/daf" class="underline decoration-[#4a4128] hover:!text-[#a3a08f]">Daf Yomi Arcade</a> —
          a new game from every daf. Texts and links via the Sefaria API.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <style is:global>
    .frank {
      font-family: 'Frank Ruhl Libre', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
    }
    .mule-card.harnessed { outline: 2px solid #e0a458; outline-offset: 2px; }
    .mule-card.departed { opacity: 0.25; pointer-events: none; }
    .mule-card.inspecting { outline: 2px solid #8fa0c0; outline-offset: 2px; }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
      .mule-card { transition: transform 0.15s ease; }
      .mule-card:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
    }
  </style>

  <script>
    // ---------- Data: the eight mules ----------
    // mother: 'donkey' | 'horse' | null (null = truly unknowable: mute AND lopped)
    const MULES = [
      { id: 'barda',   name: 'Barda',   mother: 'donkey', mute: false, lopped: false, coat: '#8a7160' },
      { id: 'shivta',  name: 'Shivta',  mother: 'horse',  mute: false, lopped: false, coat: '#9c8168' },
      { id: 'tavra',   name: 'Tavra',   mother: 'donkey', mute: true,  lopped: false, coat: '#7c6a58' },
      { id: 'sikhra',  name: 'Sikhra',  mother: 'horse',  mute: false, lopped: true,  coat: '#a08a72' },
      { id: 'naharda', name: 'Naharda', mother: 'donkey', mute: false, lopped: false, coat: '#84705a' },
      { id: 'pumba',   name: 'Pumba',   mother: 'donkey', mute: false, lopped: true,  coat: '#907a64' },
      { id: 'mesha',   name: 'Mesha',   mother: null,     mute: true,  lopped: true,  coat: '#78665a' },
      { id: 'agma',    name: 'Agma',    mother: null,     mute: true,  lopped: true,  coat: '#8e7a6a' },
    ];

    const KOY_CASES = [
      {
        kicker: 'rav ḥisda’s first concession',
        scene: 'A buck goat mated with a doe (a wild gazelle), and she gave birth. In one day, a man slaughters the doe and her offspring.',
        q: 'Does he take lashes for oto v’et beno?',
        choices: [
          'Liable — a mother and her child fell under one sun',
          'Exempt — “an ox or a sheep”: a doe is neither',
        ],
        correct: 1,
        he: 'הַכֹּל מוֹדִים בְּהִיא צְבִיָּיה וּבְנָהּ תַּיִישׁ – שֶׁפָּטוּר',
        why: 'Rav Ḥisda: all concede he is exempt. The Torah says “whether it be a bull or a sheep, you shall not slaughter it and its offspring in one day” (Lev. 22:28) — the prohibition is written on domesticated mothers, and a doe is a wild animal: seh u’vno, not tzvi u’vno.',
        ref: 'Chullin.79b.3',
      },
      {
        kicker: 'rav ḥisda’s second concession',
        scene: 'The mirror case: a deer mated with a she-goat, and she gave birth. In one day, a man slaughters the she-goat and her deer-fathered offspring.',
        q: 'Lashes for oto v’et beno?',
        choices: [
          'Exempt — the offspring is half a wild animal',
          'Liable — “a sheep… and its offspring”: the mother is a seh, the child can be anything',
        ],
        correct: 1,
        he: 'הַכֹּל מוֹדִים בְּהִיא תְּיָישָׁה וּבְנָהּ צְבִי – שֶׁחַיָּיב, ״שֶׂה״ אָמַר רַחֲמָנָא וּבְנוֹ כֹּל דְּהוּ',
        why: 'Rav Ḥisda: all concede he is liable. The verse hangs the prohibition on the mother — “a seh… and its offspring” — and once the mother is a domesticated goat, “its offspring” covers a child of any kind, even one that takes after a wild father.',
        ref: 'Chullin.79b.4',
      },
      {
        kicker: 'the festival question',
        scene: 'A koy — deer father, goat mother — stands tied by your gate on Yom Tov. Wild animals’ blood must be covered after slaughter; digging up soil on the Festival is permitted only for a definite mitzva.',
        q: 'What do you do with it on the Festival?',
        choices: [
          'Slaughter it and cover the blood — the father was a deer',
          'Slaughter it; no covering needed — the mother was a goat',
          'Don’t slaughter it today; and if done — don’t cover the blood',
        ],
        correct: 2,
        he: 'וְרַבָּנַן סַפּוֹקֵי מְסַפְּקָא לְהוּ אִי חוֹשְׁשִׁין לְזֶרַע הָאָב אִי אֵין חוֹשְׁשִׁין',
        why: 'The Mishna (83b) rules: one may not slaughter a koy on a Festival, and after the fact its blood is not covered. The Gemara concludes this is because the Rabbis are genuinely uncertain whether the father’s seed counts — so no digging on a Festival for a mitzva that is only a maybe.',
        ref: 'Chullin.79b.12',
      },
      {
        kicker: 'the priest at your door',
        scene: 'You slaughter that same koy — deer father, goat mother — on an ordinary weekday. A priest arrives for the gifts owed from non-sacred slaughter: the foreleg, the jaw, and the maw. Gifts are owed from domesticated animals; a deer owes nothing.',
        q: 'Per the Rabbis, what does he take home?',
        choices: [
          'All the gifts — its mother was a goat',
          'Half the gifts — and for the rest: bring proof the father counts, then take it',
          'Nothing — a hybrid owes no gifts',
        ],
        correct: 1,
        he: 'בִּשְׁלָמָא לְרַבָּנַן, מַאי ״חַיָּיב״ – בַּחֲצִי מַתָּנוֹת',
        why: 'The mother’s goat-half certainly owes gifts — so half is given. The father’s half is a doubt, and the burden of proof lies on the claimant: the owner tells the priest, bring proof that the father’s seed counts and take the other half too.',
        ref: 'Chullin.79b.17',
      },
    ];

    // ---------- SVG mule ----------
    function muleSVG(m, big) {
      const w = big ? 280 : 130;
      const earLen = m.lopped ? 5 : m.mother === 'donkey' ? 22 : 10;
      const c = m.coat;
      let tail = '';
      if (m.lopped) {
        tail = `<path d="M112 44 l6 7" stroke="${c}" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                <path d="M115 49 l5 -2 M114 52 l5 1" stroke="#5c4437" stroke-width="1.6"/>`;
      } else if (m.mother === 'donkey') {
        tail = `<path d="M113 43 C118 52, 119 58, 118 63" stroke="${c}" stroke-width="2.4" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                <ellipse cx="118.5" cy="66" rx="3.4" ry="5" fill="#4e3c30"/>`;
      } else {
        tail = `<path d="M113 42 C124 52, 125 70, 118 86" stroke="#4e3c30" stroke-width="6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                <path d="M113 44 C120 54, 121 68, 115 82" stroke="#5c4437" stroke-width="3" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/>`;
      }
      let ears = '';
      if (m.lopped) {
        ears = `<path d="M28 13 l3 -5 l3 5 z M36 12 l3 -5 l3 5 z" fill="${c}"/>
                <path d="M27 9 l8 -1 M35 8 l8 -1" stroke="#5c4437" stroke-width="1.4"/>`;
      } else {
        ears = `<path d="M28 14 C26 ${14 - earLen}, 30 ${12 - earLen}, 32 ${13 - earLen} C34 ${12 - earLen}, 34 8, 33 13 Z" fill="${c}"/>
                <path d="M37 13 C35 ${13 - earLen}, 39 ${11 - earLen}, 41 ${12 - earLen} C43 ${11 - earLen}, 43 7, 42 12 Z" fill="${c}"/>`;
      }
      return `<svg viewBox="0 -14 140 106" width="${w}" role="img" aria-label="${m.name} the mule" class="mx-auto block">
        ${tail}
        <rect x="56" y="60" width="5" height="30" rx="2" fill="${c}"/>
        <rect x="68" y="62" width="5" height="28" rx="2" fill="${c}"/>
        <rect x="88" y="62" width="5" height="28" rx="2" fill="${c}"/>
        <rect x="100" y="60" width="5" height="30" rx="2" fill="${c}"/>
        <ellipse cx="80" cy="50" rx="34" ry="18" fill="${c}"/>
        <path d="M50 44 L60 58 L40 26 L33 20 Z" fill="${c}"/>
        <ellipse cx="31" cy="22" rx="14" ry="8.5" fill="${c}" transform="rotate(-14 31 22)"/>
        <ellipse cx="20" cy="26" rx="5.5" ry="4.4" fill="#6b5546"/>
        ${ears}
        <circle cx="30" cy="19" r="1.7" fill="#171208"/>
        <path d="M14 92 H126" stroke="#2a2c38" stroke-width="2"/>
      </svg>`;
    }

    // ---------- Audio: the bray ----------
    let actx = null;
    function audio() {
      if (!actx) actx = new (window.AudioContext || window.webkitAudioContext)();
      return actx;
    }
    function bray(base) {
      const ctx = audio();
      const t = ctx.currentTime;
      const o = ctx.createOscillator();
      const f = ctx.createBiquadFilter();
      const g = ctx.createGain();
      o.type = 'sawtooth';
      f.type = 'lowpass';
      f.frequency.value = base * 7;
      o.connect(f); f.connect(g); g.connect(ctx.destination);
      o.frequency.setValueAtTime(base * 1.15, t);            // hee — rising
      o.frequency.linearRampToValueAtTime(base * 1.75, t + 0.28);
      o.frequency.setValueAtTime(base * 0.95, t + 0.34);     // haw — falling
      o.frequency.linearRampToValueAtTime(base * 0.55, t + 0.8);
      g.gain.setValueAtTime(0.0001, t);
      g.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.22, t + 0.06);
      g.gain.setValueAtTime(0.22, t + 0.27);
      g.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.0001, t + 0.33);
      g.gain.setValueAtTime(0.0001, t + 0.34);
      g.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.26, t + 0.42);
      g.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.0001, t + 0.85);
      o.start(t); o.stop(t + 0.9);
    }
    function huff() {
      const ctx = audio();
      const t = ctx.currentTime;
      const len = 0.35;
      const buf = ctx.createBuffer(1, ctx.sampleRate * len, ctx.sampleRate);
      const d = buf.getChannelData(0);
      for (let i = 0; i < d.length; i++) d[i] = (Math.random() * 2 - 1) * (1 - i / d.length);
      const src = ctx.createBufferSource();
      src.buffer = buf;
      const f = ctx.createBiquadFilter();
      f.type = 'lowpass'; f.frequency.value = 700;
      const g = ctx.createGain(); g.gain.value = 0.06;
      src.connect(f); f.connect(g); g.connect(ctx.destination);
      src.start(t);
    }

    // ---------- State ----------
    let order = [];
    let slots = [null, null];      // mule ids
    let wagonsDone = 0;
    let strikes = 0;
    let inspecting = null;         // mule id
    let koyIdx = 0;
    let koyScore = 0;
    const byId = (id) => MULES.find((m) => m.id === id);
    const $ = (id) => document.getElementById(id);

    const departed = new Set();
    const listened = new Set();

    function shuffle(a) {
      for (let i = a.length - 1; i > 0; i--) {
        const j = Math.floor(Math.random() * (i + 1));
        [a[i], a[j]] = [a[j], a[i]];
      }
      return a;
    }

    // ---------- Render ----------
    function renderBadges() {
      $('wagon-badges').innerHTML = [0, 1, 2]
        .map((i) =>
          `<span class="rounded-full border px-2.5 py-1 text-xs ${
            i < wagonsDone
              ? 'border-[#b3924f] bg-[#171408] !text-[#e0a458]'
              : 'border-[#2a2c38] !text-[#6e6b5d]'
          }">🛞 ${i < wagonsDone ? 'sent' : '·'}</span>`
        )
        .join('');
      $('strike-tally').textContent = `⚠️ ${strikes} kilayim strike${strikes === 1 ? '' : 's'}`;
      $('wagon-kicker').textContent = `rispak ${Math.min(wagonsDone + 1, 3)} of 3`;
    }

    function renderSlots() {
      [0, 1].forEach((i) => {
        const el = $('slot-' + i);
        const id = slots[i];
        const label = i === 0 ? 'near pole' : 'far pole';
        if (id) {
          const m = byId(id);
          el.innerHTML = `${muleSVG(m, false)}<span class="mt-1 block text-xs font-bold !text-[#e0a458]">${m.name} — tap to unharness</span>`;
          el.classList.remove('border-dashed');
          el.setAttribute('aria-label', `Wagon slot ${i + 1} — ${m.name}. Activate to unharness.`);
        } else {
          el.innerHTML = `<span class="block text-2xl">🪢</span>${label} — empty`;
          el.classList.add('border-dashed');
          el.setAttribute('aria-label', `Wagon slot ${i + 1} — empty`);
        }
      });
      $('btn-drive').disabled = !(slots[0] && slots[1]);
    }

    function renderStable() {
      $('stable-grid').innerHTML = order
        .map((id) => {
          const m = byId(id);
          const gone = departed.has(id);
          const inWagon = slots.includes(id);
          const cls = [
            'mule-card rounded-xl border border-[#2a2c38] bg-[#10131b] p-2 text-center',
            gone ? 'departed' : '',
            inWagon ? 'harnessed' : '',
            inspecting === id ? 'inspecting' : '',
          ].join(' ');
          const tag = gone
            ? '<span class="text-[10px] !text-[#6e6b5d]">departed</span>'
            : inWagon
              ? '<span class="text-[10px] !text-[#e0a458]">harnessed</span>'
              : '<span class="text-[10px] !text-[#6e6b5d]">in stable</span>';
          return `<button data-mule="${id}" class="${cls}" ${gone ? 'disabled' : ''} aria-label="Inspect ${m.name}">
            ${muleSVG(m, false)}
            <span class="block text-xs font-bold !text-[#e6e1d5]">${m.name}</span>${tag}
          </button>`;
        })
        .join('');
      document.querySelectorAll('[data-mule]').forEach((b) => {
        b.addEventListener('click', () => openInspect(b.getAttribute('data-mule')));
      });
    }

    function openInspect(id) {
      inspecting = id;
      const m = byId(id);
      $('insp').classList.remove('hidden');
      $('insp-name').textContent = m.name;
      $('insp-svg').innerHTML = muleSVG(m, true);
      $('voice-readout').textContent = listened.has(id) ? voiceText(m) : 'prod her and listen.';
      $('body-readout').textContent = bodyText(m);
      $('btn-harness').disabled = slots.includes(id) || !(slots[0] === null || slots[1] === null);
      $('btn-harness').textContent = slots.includes(id) ? '🪢 Already harnessed' : '🪢 Harness her to the rispak';
      renderStable();
      $('insp').scrollIntoView({ behavior: matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches ? 'auto' : 'smooth', block: 'nearest' });
    }

    function voiceText(m) {
      if (m.mute) return 'nothing. Not a sound — she is mute (אִלֶּמֶת). Abaye’s test is useless here.';
      return m.mother === 'donkey'
        ? 'a deep, chesty bray rolls out of her — עָבֵי קָלֵיהּ.'
        : 'a shrill, ringing bray — צְנִיף קָלֵיהּ.';
    }
    function bodyText(m) {
      if (m.lopped) return 'her ears and tail have been cropped (גִּידֶּמֶת) — there is nothing left to measure.';
      return m.mother === 'donkey'
        ? 'ears long as jug handles; a short, tufted tail.'
        : 'small, neat ears; a long, flowing tail.';
    }

    // ---------- Wagon judgment ----------
    function judge() {
      const a = byId(slots[0]);
      const b = byId(slots[1]);
      const box = $('wagon-verdict');
      box.classList.remove('hidden');
      const unknowable = [a, b].filter((m) => m.mute && m.lopped);
      if (unknowable.length) {
        strikes++;
        box.className = 'mt-3 rounded-xl border border-[#5c3a2e] bg-[#2a1712] p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed !text-[#d9917f]';
        box.innerHTML = `<span class="frank" dir="rtl" lang="he">בְּאִלֶּמֶת וְגִידֶּמֶת!</span>
          <strong class="!text-[#e6c9c0]">${unknowable.map((m) => m.name).join(' and ')}</strong> is mute <em>and</em> cropped —
          no voice for Abaye, nothing for Rav Pappa. No one can ever vouch for her kind, so she may not be
          yoked with anyone (79a:11). Rabbi Abba said: only mules <span class="frank" dir="rtl" lang="he">דְּדָמְיָין לַהֲדָדֵי</span>.
          Back to the stable, all of them.`;
        slots = [null, null];
      } else if (a.mother !== b.mother) {
        strikes++;
        box.className = 'mt-3 rounded-xl border border-[#5c3a2e] bg-[#2a1712] p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed !text-[#d9917f]';
        box.innerHTML = `<span class="frank" dir="rtl" lang="he">כִּלְאַיִם!</span>
          ${a.name} is <span class="frank" dir="rtl" lang="he">${a.mother === 'donkey' ? 'בַּר חַמָּרָא' : 'בַּר סוּסְיָא'}</span>
          and ${b.name} is <span class="frank" dir="rtl" lang="he">${b.mother === 'donkey' ? 'בַּר חַמָּרָא' : 'בַּר סוּסְיָא'}</span> —
          a donkey’s daughter and a horse’s daughter on one pole. The signs are Torah-law
          (<span class="frank" dir="rtl" lang="he">וְסִימָנִין דְּאוֹרָיְיתָא</span>, 79b:1) — and they testify against you. Unharness them.`;
        slots = [null, null];
      } else {
        wagonsDone++;
        const how = (m) =>
          m.mute
            ? `${m.name} by Rav Pappa’s test (ears &amp; tail)`
            : m.lopped
              ? `${m.name} by Abaye’s test (voice alone)`
              : `${m.name} by voice, ears, and tail`;
        box.className = 'mt-3 rounded-xl border border-[#5a4a26] bg-[#171408] p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed !text-[#cfc39e]';
        box.innerHTML = `<span class="frank !text-[#e0a458]" dir="rtl" lang="he">דְּדָמְיָין לַהֲדָדֵי!</span>
          Both ${a.mother === 'donkey' ? 'daughters of donkeys' : 'daughters of horses'} —
          ${how(a)}, ${how(b)}. Rabbi Abba nods; the rispak rolls off into the dark.`;
        departed.add(a.id); departed.add(b.id);
        slots = [null, null];
      }
      inspecting = null;
      $('insp').classList.add('hidden');
      renderBadges(); renderSlots(); renderStable();
      if (wagonsDone === 3) {
        setTimeout(() => {
          $('game-area').classList.add('hidden');
          $('mid').classList.remove('hidden');
          $('mid').scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'auto', block: 'start' });
        }, 900);
      }
    }

    // ---------- Koy gate ----------
    function renderKoy() {
      const c = KOY_CASES[koyIdx];
      $('koy-kicker').textContent = `the koy gate · case ${koyIdx + 1} of 4 · ${c.kicker}`;
      $('koy-scene').textContent = c.scene;
      $('koy-q').textContent = c.q;
      $('koy-feedback').classList.add('hidden');
      $('koy-choices').innerHTML = c.choices
        .map(
          (ch, i) =>
            `<button data-choice="${i}" class="block w-full rounded-xl border border-[#2c3a30] bg-[#0b0f0c] px-4 py-3 text-left text-sm !text-[#c9d4ca] transition-colors hover:border-[#7fae8b] hover:!text-[#e6e1d5]">${ch}</button>`
        )
        .join('');
      document.querySelectorAll('[data-choice]').forEach((b) => {
        b.addEventListener('click', () => answerKoy(parseInt(b.getAttribute('data-choice'), 10)));
      });
    }

    function answerKoy(i) {
      const c = KOY_CASES[koyIdx];
      const right = i === c.correct;
      if (right) koyScore++;
      document.querySelectorAll('[data-choice]').forEach((b) => {
        const idx = parseInt(b.getAttribute('data-choice'), 10);
        b.disabled = true;
        if (idx === c.correct) b.className = 'block w-full rounded-xl border border-[#7fae8b] bg-[#12241a] px-4 py-3 text-left text-sm !text-[#a8c9ae]';
        else if (idx === i) b.className = 'block w-full rounded-xl border border-[#5c3a2e] bg-[#2a1712] px-4 py-3 text-left text-sm !text-[#d9917f]';
      });
      const fb = $('koy-feedback');
      fb.classList.remove('hidden');
      fb.className = `mt-3 rounded-xl border p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed ${right ? 'border-[#7fae8b] bg-[#12241a] !text-[#a8c9ae]' : 'border-[#5c3a2e] bg-[#2a1712] !text-[#d9917f]'}`;
      fb.innerHTML = `<p class="font-bold">${right ? '✓ So rules the daf.' : '✗ The daf rules otherwise.'}</p>
        <p class="frank mt-1 text-lg !text-[#e6e1d5]" dir="rtl" lang="he">${c.he}</p>
        <p class="mt-2 !text-[#c9d4ca]">${c.why}</p>
        <a href="https://www.sefaria.org/${c.ref}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="mt-2 inline-block text-xs !text-[#7fae8b] hover:underline">${c.ref.replace(/\./g, ' ')} ↗</a>
        <div class="mt-3"><button id="btn-koy-next" class="rounded-xl bg-[#7fae8b] px-5 py-2 text-sm font-bold !text-[#0d120e] hover:bg-[#9cc4a6]">${koyIdx === 3 ? 'Rabbi Abba awaits →' : 'Next case →'}</button></div>`;
      $('btn-koy-next').addEventListener('click', () => {
        koyIdx++;
        if (koyIdx < 4) renderKoy();
        else endGame();
      });
      fb.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'auto', block: 'nearest' });
    }

    // ---------- End ----------
    function endGame() {
      $('koy').classList.add('hidden');
      $('end-screen').classList.remove('hidden');
      $('final-score').textContent = `${strikes === 0 ? 'clean drive' : strikes + '×⚠️'} · koy ${koyScore}/4`;
      let grade, line;
      if (strikes === 0 && koyScore === 4) {
        grade = 'שַׁמָּעֵיהּ דְּרַבִּי אַבָּא';
        line = 'Rabbi Abba’s own attendant: three wagons without a single mismatched pole, and the koy never fooled you. עַיֵּין לְהָנָךְ — you looked, exactly as told.';
      } else if (strikes <= 2 && koyScore >= 3) {
        grade = 'בַּר סוּסְיָא';
        line = 'Sharp-eared and nearly sure-footed. A strike or a slip at the gate — but you know a bray from a whinny now.';
      } else {
        grade = 'סַפּוֹקֵי מְסַפְּקָא';
        line = 'In doubt — like Rabbi Yehuda himself, the daf would say. Walk the stables again; the signs are all there.';
      }
      $('final-grade').textContent = grade;
      $('final-line').textContent = line;
      $('end-screen').scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'auto', block: 'start' });
    }

    // ---------- Wire up ----------
    function init() {
      order = shuffle(MULES.map((m) => m.id));
      slots = [null, null];
      wagonsDone = 0; strikes = 0; koyIdx = 0; koyScore = 0;
      departed.clear(); listened.clear();
      inspecting = null;
      $('game-area').classList.remove('hidden');
      $('mid').classList.add('hidden');
      $('koy').classList.add('hidden');
      $('end-screen').classList.add('hidden');
      $('insp').classList.add('hidden');
      $('wagon-verdict').classList.add('hidden');
      renderBadges(); renderSlots(); renderStable();
    }

    $('btn-listen').addEventListener('click', () => {
      if (!inspecting) return;
      const m = byId(inspecting);
      listened.add(m.id);
      if (m.mute) huff();
      else bray(m.mother === 'donkey' ? 120 : 330);
      $('voice-readout').textContent = voiceText(m);
    });

    $('btn-harness').addEventListener('click', () => {
      if (!inspecting) return;
      const free = slots[0] === null ? 0 : slots[1] === null ? 1 : -1;
      if (free === -1 || slots.includes(inspecting)) return;
      slots[free] = inspecting;
      inspecting = null;
      $('insp').classList.add('hidden');
      $('wagon-verdict').classList.add('hidden');
      renderSlots(); renderStable();
    });

    [0, 1].forEach((i) => {
      $('slot-' + i).addEventListener('click', () => {
        if (slots[i]) {
          slots[i] = null;
          $('wagon-verdict').classList.add('hidden');
          renderSlots(); renderStable();
        }
      });
    });

    $('btn-drive').addEventListener('click', judge);
    $('btn-close').addEventListener('click', () => {
      inspecting = null;
      $('insp').classList.add('hidden');
      renderStable();
    });
    $('btn-road').addEventListener('click', () => {
      $('mid').classList.add('hidden');
      $('koy').classList.remove('hidden');
      renderKoy();
      $('koy').scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'auto', block: 'start' });
    });
    $('btn-replay').addEventListener('click', () => {
      init();
      $('game-area').scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'auto', block: 'start' });
    });
    $('btn-share').addEventListener('click', async () => {
      const text = `🐴 The Rispak Stables — Chullin 79\n3 wagons driven, ${strikes} kilayim strike${strikes === 1 ? '' : 's'} · the koy gate ${koyScore}/4\nhttps://matthewmiller.dev/daf/chullin-79`;
      try {
        if (navigator.share) await navigator.share({ text });
        else {
          await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);
          $('btn-share').textContent = 'Copied!';
          setTimeout(() => ($('btn-share').textContent = 'Share score'), 1500);
        }
      } catch (e) { /* user dismissed share sheet */ }
    });

    init();
  </script>
</Layout>
